    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of acquiring or using an assumed identity without authority.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the person is an authorised person (other than an authorised civilian); and (b) the person acquires evidence of, or uses, an assumed identity;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(d) the person is reckless as to the circumstance mentioned in paragraph (c).";
