    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prevents reading or considering victim impact statements under certain conditions.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(5) A victim impact statement is not to be read to the court, or otherwise taken into account, to the extent that:  (a) it expresses an opinion about an appropriate sentence; or  (b) it is offensive, threatening, intimidating or harassing; or  (c) admitting it into evidence would otherwise not be in the interests of justice.";
