    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Court must not pass sentence of imprisonment unless exceptional circumstances warrant it.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) a person is convicted of one or more section 17B offences relating to property, money or both, whose total value is not more than $2,000;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the court convicting the person is not to pass a sentence of imprisonment for that offence, or for any of those offences, unless the court is satisfied that there are exceptional circumstances that warrant it.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
