    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Overlaps";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The offence occurred before the sentence was passed";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) the person has not previously been sentenced to imprisonment for any federal, State or Territory offence;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the offence occurred before the sentence was passed";
