<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-act-1914-sec-23dc-ss-1-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Imposes a duty on the state to specify the period during which suspension or delay of questioning may be applied.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a person is arrested for a terrorism offence; and  (b) an investigation is being conducted into whether the person committed that terrorism offence or another terrorism offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The state must specify the period during which suspension or delay of questioning may be applied.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-act-1914-sec-23dc-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-act-1914-sec-23dc-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-act-1914-sec-23dc-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/AllenInterval>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "During";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Specifies the temporal interval during which suspension or delay of questioning may be applied.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a person is arrested for a terrorism offence; and  (b) an investigation is being conducted into whether the person committed that terrorism offence or another terrorism offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The period during which suspension or delay of questioning may be applied starts when the person is arrested and ends when the investigation is completed.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-act-1914-sec-23dc-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/crimes-act-1914-sec-23dc-ss-1-logic-ltl-3>.
