    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LTL>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Until";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Specifies the temporal interval until which suspension or delay of questioning may not be applied.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a person is arrested for a terrorism offence; and  (b) an investigation is being conducted into whether the person committed that terrorism offence or another terrorism offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The period during which suspension or delay of questioning may not be applied starts when the investigation is completed and ends at the end of the relevant temporal interval.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::temporal_ltl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
